  "description": "The Outback Xplore II 29 is the ultimate steel frame bikepacking and off-road adventure bike, engineered by Tout Terrain for rugged, long-distance exploration.\nMaintenance-Free Drivetrain: At its core is the robust, tried-and-tested Pinion-specific steel frame paired with a low-maintenance Pinion C1.12 Gearbox and Chain Drive System. This system delivers reliable, maintenance-free shifting across a 600% range in any conditions.\nReady for Any Terrain: This adventure touring/bikepacking bike is built around 29\" wheels, offering clearance for up to 2.6” tires (stock tires are Vittoria Mezcal 29x2.35). The stable, comfortable geometry prioritizes control and stability for loaded off-road touring and bikepacking.\nCustomizable Carrying Capacity: The frame is equipped with ample mounting points, including additional bosses on the top and down tubes, allowing for both a modern bikepacking setup or a traditional touring rack.\nCustomize Your Ride: Complete your dream build by choosing between the rigid Tout Terrain Adventure Carbon Fork or Rockshox suspension fork option.\nThe Outback Xplore II 29 is available in sizes S, M, L, and XL.\nChain System Tout Terrain TBA III (pivotable for Pinion)",
